00:07:02,608 --> 00:07:08,608
Electric Love is a comedy film directed by Aaron Fradkin.

3
00:10:33,913 --> 00:10:39,913
Electric Love follows a group of 20-somethings as they
navigate the dating landscape of modern day L.A.

4
00:14:05,217 --> 00:14:11,217
These interconnected stories feature young single people in various states of
courtship whether it’s a blind-date, hook-up or a long-term relationship.

5
00:17:36,521 --> 00:17:42,521
The film explores straight, bisexual and gay
relationships as well as polyamory and monogamy.

6
00:21:07,826 --> 00:21:13,826
In an increasingly technological world, our smartphones have become an integral part
of not only how we approach dating but how we connect with others.

7
